  "prefLabel": "Puc 301.02 Notice of Intent to Produce Electricity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 301.02 Notice of Intent to Produce Electricity. Any facility located within New Hampshire proposing to generate electricity over one megawatt ultimately sold to the public shall notify the commission in writing of its intent to produce electrical energy at least 6 months prior to the date energy is first proposed to be produced.\n\nSource. #6605, eff 10-21-97, ss by #8448, eff 10-18-05; ss by #10603, eff 5-21-14; ss by #14106, eff 10-25-24, EXPIRES: 10-25-34 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Puc 300)",
